{"id":"659470","name":"鸡头米豌豆炒虾仁","author":"圆小π","authorId":"1365842","desc":"","cover":"images/659470/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"虾","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"豌豆","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡头米","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"新鲜的虾，去壳去头去虾线。","img":"images/659470/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"虾仁加入料酒，姜片腌一会儿。","img":"images/659470/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"青豆下开水煮熟，再过一下凉水。","img":"images/659470/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"鸡头米下锅烫一下，捞出来控干。","img":"images/659470/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅中烧热油，倒入姜片，虾仁炒至变色。","img":"images/659470/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"倒入鸡头米和青豆一起翻炒。","img":"images/659470/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入盐，鸡精调味。","img":"images/659470/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"淋入水淀粉。","img":"images/659470/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"翻炒均匀出锅。","img":"images/659470/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"青豆鸡头米炒虾仁。","img":"images/659470/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}